---
import BaseLayout from '@/components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import '@/styles/pdf-sheet.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Your PDF character sheet" active="play">
  <header class="page-hero"><div class="site-shell"><p class="kicker">Your sheet · Your session</p><h1>Keep your character up to date.</h1><p>Open your PDF, change your sheet, and export it for the next session. No automatic character extraction.</p><a href="/play/">← Back to Play Mode</a></div></header>
  <section class="section section--first pdf-sheet" id="pdf-sheet"><div class="site-shell">
    <p id="sheet-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Your PDF stays on this device. Nothing is saved until you choose Save to browser or Export PDF.</p>
    <p id="sheet-error" role="alert" tabindex="-1" hidden></p>
    <div id="sheet-loading" hidden><progress aria-label="Opening your PDF"></progress><button class="button" id="sheet-cancel" type="button">Cancel opening</button></div>
    <section id="sheet-upload" class="tool-panel" aria-labelledby="upload-title">
      <h2 id="upload-title">Open your character sheet</h2>
      <div class="sheet-drop" id="sheet-drop"><label for="pdf-file"><strong>Drop a PDF here, or choose a file</strong><span>Up to 15 MB · 20 pages · no D&D Beyond login needed</span></label><input id="pdf-file" type="file" accept="application/pdf,.pdf" /></div>
      <p>Edit fillable fields directly on the page. For printed text, add an editable text box with an optional white cover.</p>
      <p class="sheet-note">No OCR, automatic character reader, or upload to a server. PDFs do not update your old character snapshots or personalized suggestions.</p>
    </section>
    <section id="pdf-editor" hidden aria-labelledby="editor-title">
      <div class="sheet-editor-heading"><div><h2 id="editor-title" tabindex="-1">Your editable sheet</h2><p id="sheet-info"></p></div><button class="button" type="button" id="sheet-close">Close sheet</button></div>
      <label for="sheet-title" class="field-label">Sheet name</label><input id="sheet-title" class="field" type="text" maxlength="150" />
      <div class="sheet-actions"><button class="button button--primary" id="sheet-export" type="button">Export PDF</button><button class="button" id="sheet-save" type="button">Save to browser</button><button class="button" id="sheet-original" type="button">Download original</button><span id="sheet-save-state">Not saved in this browser</span></div>
      <p class="sheet-note">Export after your session for a portable backup. Save to browser keeps the original and your latest editable PDF in this browser profile. Clearing site data removes local copies; shared profiles share access.</p>
      <div class="sheet-toolbar" aria-label="PDF controls">
        <button class="button" id="page-prev" type="button" aria-label="Previous PDF page">←</button><label for="page-select">Page</label><select class="field" id="page-select"></select><button class="button" id="page-next" type="button" aria-label="Next PDF page">→</button>
        <label for="zoom-select">Zoom</label><select class="field" id="zoom-select"><option value="fit">Fit width</option><option value="1">100%</option><option value="1.5">150%</option><option value="2">200%</option></select>
        <button class="button" id="text-add" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Add text</button><button class="button" id="text-replace" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Cover &amp; replace text</button>
      </div>
      <p id="sheet-tool-help">Click a highlighted field to change its value. Page controls and all fields also work with a keyboard.</p>
      <div class="sheet-workspace">
        <div class="sheet-viewport" id="sheet-viewport" tabindex="0" aria-label="Scrollable PDF page"><div id="pdf-page"><canvas id="pdf-canvas" role="img" aria-label="Character sheet PDF page"></canvas><div id="pdf-fields"></div><div id="pdf-additions"></div><div id="text-placement" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-label="Place text on PDF page. Click a position, or press Enter to place a box near the top." hidden></div></div></div>
        <aside id="text-properties" class="sheet-properties" hidden aria-labelledby="text-properties-title"><h3 id="text-properties-title">Added text</h3><label for="text-value">Text</label><textarea id="text-value" class="field" rows="3" maxlength="4000"></textarea><label for="text-size">Text size</label><input class="field" id="text-size" type="number" min="6" max="48" step="1" value="12" /><div class="sheet-geometry"><label>Left<input class="field" id="text-x" type="number" min="0" step="1" /></label><label>Top<input class="field" id="text-y" type="number" min="0" step="1" /></label><label>Width<input class="field" id="text-width" type="number" min="12" step="1" /></label><label>Height<input class="field" id="text-height" type="number" min="12" step="1" /></label></div><label class="sheet-check"><input type="checkbox" id="text-cover" />White cover behind text</label><p class="sheet-note">A white cover visually hides printed text underneath; it does not securely delete it. This is not a redaction tool.</p><button class="button" id="text-remove" type="button">Remove added text</button></aside>
      </div>
      <details class="sheet-help"><summary>How to update your sheet</summary><ol><li>Click a highlighted field, select its old value, and type the new value. Delete the value to clear it.</li><li>If the page has no editable field, select <strong>Cover &amp; replace text</strong> and click over the printed value. Adjust the text box in the side panel. Use <strong>Add text</strong> for notes.</li><li>Choose <strong>Export PDF</strong>. Reopen the exported file here next session; its fields and added text remain editable.</li></ol><p>This edits your copy of the PDF, not your D&D Beyond account. Printed text covered with a box is still present underneath. Signed, locked, or unsupported forms may need an unlocked, unsigned export.</p></details>
    </section>
    <section class="sheet-library tool-panel" aria-labelledby="saved-title"><h2 id="saved-title">Saved in this browser</h2><p class="sheet-note">Local copies, not cloud storage. Your existing character snapshots remain separate and unchanged.</p><div id="saved-sheets"><p>Loading saved sheets…</p></div></section>
    <noscript><p>The private PDF editor needs JavaScript to display and save your sheet on this device.</p></noscript>
  </div></section>
  <script>import '@/features/pdf-sheet/editor.mjs';</script>
</BaseLayout>
